sequenceDiagram
    participant Guest as Guest
    participant Host as Host API
    participant Store as Local store
    participant Broadcast as Fanout loop
    participant Peers as Selected connections
    Guest->>Host: CRDT update
    Host->>Host: Validate and reserve bounded queue space
    Host->>Host: Create OpId and compute updated state
    Host->>Store: Atomic state, value, seen ID, and replay op-log batch
    Store-->>Host: Flush confirmed
    Host->>Host: Publish state in memory
    Host->>Broadcast: Enqueue accepted operation
    Broadcast->>Broadcast: Drain and batch accepted operations
    Broadcast->>Broadcast: Rotate K recipients among active connections
    Broadcast->>Peers: History::Push via nx-net
    Peers->>Peers: Persist new operations before forwarding
    Note over Broadcast,Peers: Forwarding excludes sender, duplicates do not forward
    Note over Broadcast,Peers: Rotating neighbors reconnect; anti-entropy repairs gaps
